# Cloudflare Pages 用ヘッダ雛形。実機（Chrome / Safari / Android）で骨格推定と AI 解説が動くことを確認してから _headers にリネームしてください。
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net 'wasm-unsafe-eval'; connect-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://storage.googleapis.com https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com https://api.anthropic.com https://api.openai.com; img-src 'self' blob: data:; media-src 'self' blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
